          "snippet": {
            "text": "def GoodPatternPrime (p : ℕ) : Prop :=\n  p.Prime ∧ p ≠ 2 ∧ ∃ r : ZMod p, r ^ 2 = 2 ∧\n    (75 - 53 * r : ZMod p) ≠ 0 ∧ (75 + 53 * r : ZMod p) ≠ 0 ∧\n    Nat.gcd (pointCount p (-(75 - 53 * r) ^ 2)) (pointCount p (-(75 + 53 * r) ^ 2)) = 4 ∧\n    ¬ p ∣ pointCount p (-(75 - 53 * r) ^ 2) * pointCount p (-(75 + 53 * r) ^ 2)",
